{"server":"cn","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_02_beg","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_02","title":"不过别离","storyCode":"EA-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a1013c4c7bdc0b06488f3581fc13c040c2136544a00a1ebd1e0280a09e8b232f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"好多人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！呃......请让一让——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——米林顿街我也去过了，早就什么也没有了！虽然店门都开着，但货架全是空的，连个袋子都没剩下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉马那家伙说这边有库存，我才跑了五条街过来——结果还是连根羽兽毛都看不见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不如回去拿上弩，翻出岗哨去，到黑林里打点猎，兴许还能在饿死之前见点真正的荤腥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你是真饿糊涂了，去黑林才真的是去送死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不糊涂！说得像你就知道什么了一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不知道？拉格兰街的粮店，艾玛开的，你知道吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那家我还没去呢，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先去的那里。虽然也没粮食，但听艾玛的意思，这事和*维多利亚粗口*的维多利亚人脱不开干系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的混蛋封锁我们，这又不是第一天了，他们当然该负责。这有什么新鲜的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的间谍已经渗透到纳斯尔纱来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再说一遍？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾玛去农业地块的时候亲眼看见了着过火的痕迹，深池还在排查呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*维多利亚粗口*！塔拉独立之后我们就该马上打回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过有句话你说对了，你确实该回去拿上你的弩，但不是为了打猎，而是为了揪出那些替维多利亚人办事的叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然如果让我抓到他，肯定不是用弩箭穿心这么简单就结束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）好像是这些店里的粮食供应断了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）虽然我给库林先生囤了一些土豆，但可能还是不够......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）这里人太多了，还是走另一条路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）还有好多人都拿着武器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）他们是想围剿维多利亚间谍吗？城里没有粮食......跟维多利亚人也有关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）但我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我没关系的。我是库林先生的学徒。大家都知道这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"别害怕，提奥。大家不会拿你怎么样的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提奥努力矮下身子，从人群中挤出去，来到街道的拐角处。他灵活地从一条狭窄暗道里穿过，来到石砖墙体的另一面。\n嘈杂的人声逐渐从他耳边退去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看，提奥，没人找你的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"库林先生肯定还在忙红龙雕像的事，等他回过神来，其他店里肯定也什么都不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我得帮忙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g10_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们先把这些东西拿去吃，分给周围的邻居，让他们不要急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你自己怎么办？还有涅梅丝，她会不会没得吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起把粮食都给我们，你不如跟那些人一起去抓维多利亚间谍。要不然没法从根本上解决问题，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会去的，也麻烦你这样告诉其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些东西你们也先拿着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅丝在领袖的身边，为你们吃些苦也是应该的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我......那我就不跟你客气了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......库林，你肯定还有别的存粮，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你怎么知道粮食会断供？是不是涅梅丝提前跟你说了什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗里，你说什么呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有谁能证明你或者涅梅丝不是间谍？你们合起伙来养大了一个维多利亚人的孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......滚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我凭什么滚？你心虚什么？你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"库林，我听说你在发粮，真是太及时了！你发的东西都在哪儿呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的都在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别打岔。库林，你还没回答我的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能说的我都已经说了。你要是觉得这点土豆脏了你的手，就把袋子给别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗里，你到底要不要？不要就给我，多的是人要吃饭，别不识好歹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凭什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是不要吗，给我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想得美——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"袋子里的土豆个头极小，没一个长成正常的椭圆形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的胳膊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，出血了！罗里，你怎么能对同胞动刀？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我、我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把刀放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别逼我用这把锤子对付你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还、还得是你啊，库林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗里的状态不太对，我跟上去瞧瞧......自从他收藏的那些古董在战争中被一把火烧了之后，他就一直疯疯癫癫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于他的刀——他的刀你就收起来吧，库林。别再还给他了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"库林，我......唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口不深，过来，我先帮你止血。粮食的事，等涅梅丝回来，我请她想想办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......嘶......我知道，你是真的把自己有的都拿出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也就是看上去凶巴巴的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少说话，节省力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家里可能还剩了点玉米粉，我去找找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿上，然后我送你回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g10_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"库林，你和提奥还好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......地上怎么有血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗里失控砍伤了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奥一早就出去了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......糟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，没人能想到事情会突然变成这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城里现在怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到处都在传是维多利亚人破坏了农业地块，纳斯尔纱已经快炸锅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你之前给提奥出了一次头之后没人敢欺负他，你才放心他到处跑。可这次......不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我现在去找他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的雕像还来得及吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雕像得在夏末节前完工，时间只剩一点点了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奥的事我会去管。你就专心做好手头的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"库林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看见提奥了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奥？那孩子又跑到哪里偷懒去了？库林太惯着他了，你真该说说他......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g3_dragonsquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奥，提奥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子闯什么祸了，让你这么找？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看见过提奥吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？我还好，就是太饿了。怎么了？你刚才说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来得正好！涅梅丝，提奥那小子最近没什么可疑行为吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有，他忙还忙不过来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，他最好是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“守灵人”小姐？你怎么还在这儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——哦，“歌唱家”先生。您在这儿做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“歌唱家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"听闻城中发生了一些混乱，我想看看有没有什么自己能做的，结果，唉，无能为力，只听说供应短缺是维多利亚人破坏所致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“歌唱家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"可我唯一一次和维多利亚人的军队碰上纯属意外，那次还是承蒙您和库林先生把我救出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“歌唱家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"还有您为我提供的关于守灵人的信息，真的令我受益良多——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，“歌唱家”先生，我实在没时间和您叙旧了——对了，您能帮我个忙吗？库林的学徒提奥失踪了，您能帮我找找他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“歌唱家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"这......我爱莫能助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“歌唱家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"城里人现在提起维多利亚人恨不得扒了他们的皮，你又何苦为了一个维多利亚小孩四处奔忙呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我自己找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“歌唱家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"我也得给您提个醒，庆功会还有一个多小时就开始了，您不是还要把象征守灵人祝福的祭器送到会场去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“歌唱家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，您也真是......抱歉，我先失陪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅丝，是你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于找到你了......城里到底出什么事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
